  "details": "I uploaded sample Excellent robot avatars with 31 & 41 face tracking Forwarded Parameters to force the avatars down to Poor & Very Poor rank. The website reports the avatar's performance rating as Excellent, which is incorrect.\n\nAffected private avatars by WubTheCaptain:\n\n- Robot （Poor forwarded parameters） `avtr_f65a0f15-6f36-400a-a7bd-42f5dbcbf78a`\n\n- Robot （Very Poor forwarded parameters） `avtr_f65a0f15-6f36-400a-a7bd-42f5dbcbf78a`\n\nExpected result: Poor (31 forwarded parameters) & Very Poor (41 forwarded parameters), as reported in the SDK (`3.10.6`) and in performance stats of the avatar (VRChat 2026.4.1p3 Build `1939`).\n\nActual result: The website reports the avatars as Excellent.\n\nRelevant client bug report: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/my-avatars-does-not-account-forwarded-parameters-in-avatar-performance-rating-se",
